    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"The Department of Surgery, Cardiothoracic section, in collaboration with AKU School of Nursing and Midwifery, has initiated the first-ever Advance Nurse Practitioner programme in Pakistan. This is a one year, on-the-job training programme which involves advance level teaching and supervision of five mid-level nurses working at the cardiac intensive care unit at Aga Khan University Hospital.",
